@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-12">
        <p class="lead">HARSAC is a nodal agency of the Department of Science & Technology, Government of Haryana, for Remote Sensing and GIS applications.</p>
        
        <h3>Our Vision</h3>
        <p>To use space technology for the benefit of society and to facilitate sustainable development in the state of Haryana.</p>

        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>To act as a nodal agency for Remote Sensing and GIS activities in the State.</li>
            <li>To provide space-based inputs for planning and monitoring of developmental activities.</li>
            <li>To capacity building in the field of Remote Sensing and GIS.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>History</h3>
        <p>Haryana Space Applications Centre (HARSAC) was established in 1986. Since its inception, it has completed numerous projects related to natural resource mapping, environmental monitoring, and disaster management.</p>
    </div>
</div>
